          "provides": [],
          "brew": null,
          "arch": null,
          "debian": "python3-dev libxcb1-dev libxcb-render0-dev libxcb-shape0-dev libxcb-xfixes0-dev libxkbcommon-dev libssl-dev libfontconfig1-dev libfreetype-dev libharfbuzz-dev libexpat1-dev libx11-dev libgl1-mesa-dev libegl1-mesa-dev libpango1.0-dev libcairo2-dev",
          "optional": true,
          "note": "headers the from-source fallbacks need on Debian. python3-dev because Debian ships Python.h separately, and it belongs here rather than on the `python` entry: that one resolves to `have` on any machine that can run this script, so its package list is never installed. xcb/fontconfig/freetype are the cargo builds (silicon, resvg, typst). The rest are manim on aarch64, which has no wheels for two dependencies and builds both: moderngl's glcontext compiles an x11.cpp needing X11/Xlib.h even on a headless box, and manimpango's configure ends at `RequiredDependencyException: pangocairo >= 1.30.0 is required`. Arch covers all of these through base-devel and the graphics stack."
        },
